/-!
# S9-C3h200o: same-actual primary-constraint preservation

C3h200n changes only the Lorentz-connection germ of the already generated
coherent profile actual.  This module therefore rechecks the primary
constraint channels on that very same final actual.  No restart, projection,
residual inverse, target witness, branch receipt, or supplied constraint
certificate enters the proof.

The simplicity value and its canonical-time tangent are genuine same-actual
acceptances inherited through exact primitive-field fidelity.  Transporting
the already established tangent law to the connection-corrected actual does
not count it a second time.  The P286 Gauss leg below is likewise classified
by its actual producer history: the radial auxiliary profile was generated by
the P286 action equation, so preserving it across the later coframe and
Lorentz writes is producer consistency, not a new independent equation.

Nothing here is a flow, positive-time propagation, or full joint
stationarity.  In particular, the state-dependent response at the corrected
current has not yet been regenerated.
-/

